{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-olivz","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"olivz-danube-dubai-international-city","about":"Olivz is a luxury project by developer Danube Properties. The 7-storey residential complex is located in the mixed-use neighborhood of Al Warsan First in one of the most sought-after locations in Dubai. Olivz offers elegant and modern residences, where the complex is surrounded by landscaped gardens and water bodies. For sale are studios and apartments with 1 and 2 bedrooms. The interiors are designed in a modern style using neutral tones, which creates a cozy atmosphere. Also made with high quality finishing materials and fully equipped with modern furniture and appliances.World-class amenities are provided for residents: gym, tennis court, swimming pool, children's pool, recreation areas, children's playground, SPA area, sports fields, as well as within walking distance to cafes, restaurants and retail outlets. Every aspect is precisely organized to provide the perfect living space.The Al Warsan First neighborhood is well positioned to provide Olivz residents with quick access to key points in Dubai. Dubai Safari, Dubai Silicon Oasis, Meydan Racecourse and Dubai Safari are just 10 minutes away. Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa are approximately 20 minutes away. Palm Jumeirah is 30 minutes away. Dubai International Airport is 13 minutes away.","price":1371000,"title":"Olivz","bitrix":{"id":454,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Olivz","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Olivz","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Danube Properties","project_location":"International City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1597/images/2024/04/08/340x252/UlpIjPlrjZlCHKZ4Guzv77iFdzTHBsrzf70wMdq2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1597/images/2024/04/08/464x312/UlpIjPlrjZlCHKZ4Guzv77iFdzTHBsrzf70wM